 /// The adjustable numbers in Steel's meal formula. The saved copy (Settings → Meal Breakdown) is
 /// the default for each meal; the Meal Breakdown tab can change them for one meal.
 struct MealBreakdownFormula: Codable, Equatable {
-    /// Percent of starches in the 🌮 medium entry; the 🍕 delayed entry gets the rest.
+    /// Percent of starches in the 🌮 medium entry.
     var mediumStarchPercent: Double = 60
+    /// Percent of starches in the 🍕 delayed entry. Set separately; the two don't have to add to 100.
